AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_30212> "Particle of zero charge, zero rest mass, spin quantum number 1, energy <em>h</em><em>ν</em> and momentum <em>h</em><em>ν</em>/<em>c</em> (<em>h</em> is the Planck constant, <em>ν</em> the frequency of radiation and <em>c</em> the speed of light), carrier of electromagnetic force.")
